    "number": 2,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "third heaven -- First heaven, of clouds; second, of stars; third, God's abode."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 4,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "paradise -- See note on hades, (See Scofield \"Luke 16:23\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 7,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "thorn -- It has been conjectured that Paul's \"thorn in the flesh\" was chronic ophthalmia, inducing bodily weakness, and a repulsive appearance Galatians 4:15; 1 Corinthians 2:3,4; 2 Corinthians 10:10. This cannot be positively known, and the reserve of Scripture is as sure a mark of inspiration as its revelations. Paul's particular \"thorn\" is not described that his consolations may avail for all to who any thorn is given."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 9,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "perfect in -- (See Scofield \"Matthew 5:48\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 21,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "sinned -- Sin. (See Scofield \"Romans 3:23\")."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
